<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia share trading system restored-ASX.</title>
<headline>Australia share trading system restored-ASX.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) said on Tuesday its SEATS trading system had been restored after technical problems and that the market would re-open at 10.40 a.m. (0040 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
